遊處，於是立精舍於懸霤，而往來茅嶺之洞室，放絕世務，以尋仙館，朔望時節還家定省而已。父母既終，乃遣婦孫氏還家，遂攜其同志遍游名山焉。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-w080-line120-bao:a","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line120","start":84,"end":88,"surface":"南海太守","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line120:m0088","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"依本句所授、所歷或任時稱謂。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null},{"id":"th-w080-office-bao","person_id":"o8f_bqq_bot","title":"南海太守","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-095","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-095-jin080-xumai","source_id":"s-jinshu-095-jin080-xumai","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-095-jin080-xumai:office","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-095-jin080-xumai:office:m0000","quote":"靚學兼內外，明天文河洛書，稍遷南陽中部都尉，為南海太守。"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-w080-office-bao:a","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-095-jin080-xumai:office","start":23,"end":27,"surface":"南海太守","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-095-jin080-xumai:office:m0000","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"依本句所授、所歷或任時稱謂。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-jinshu-080-wangxizhi-family:line120","text":"許邁，字叔玄，一名映，丹陽句容人也。家世士族，而邁少恬靜，不慕仕進。未弱冠，嘗造郭璞，璞為之筮，遇《泰》之《大畜》，其上六爻發。璞謂曰：「君元吉自天，宜學升遐之道。」時南海太守鮑靚隱跡潛遁，人莫之知。邁乃往候之，探其至要。父母尚存，未忍違親。謂余杭懸霤山近延陵之茅山，是洞庭西門，潛通五嶽，陳安世、茅季偉常所遊處，於是立精舍於懸霤，而往來茅嶺之洞室，放絕世務，以尋仙館，朔望時節還家定省而已。父母既終，乃遣婦孫氏還家，遂攜其同志遍游名山焉。","text_la